From 763d42f970264a46e63614e2ffd06be6e3b6d227 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:27:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: legacy views redirected to the Plait app; stale code
 removed

Redirected:
- Images other apps open (VIEW / REVIEW, content and file URIs) open in
  the Plait viewer: within the library when the photo is in it, on its own
  otherwise (no album, favorite or trash for a foreign image; images
  without thumbnails are decoded); Back returns to the app
- The old launcher names (com.android.gallery3d.app.Gallery,
  com.cooliris.media.Gallery) are aliases of the Plait library
- Set wallpaper picks through the Plait picker; the video player's up
  goes to the Plait library

Removed (nothing reaches them any more):
- The legacy GL gallery: GalleryActivity, its pages, renderer, data
  layer, GalleryAppImpl; the camera stub and its boot receiver; MTP
  import; trim and mute video; photo widgets and pickers; Picasa/sync
  settings, GalleryProvider, PhotoProvider, PackagesMonitor, BatchService;
  the com.android.photos prototype - 303 classes
- Their layouts, drawables, value entries, colours and 426 unused strings
  in every language; libjni_eglfence; mp4parser, the Apache HTTP stubs,
  the androidx legacy support libraries (androidx.print added directly)
- Permissions only those needed: location, camera, accounts, sync, NFC,
  boot, audio, vibrate, settings, network state, the provider permission;
  proguard rules for removed code

versionCode 40068

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
